            "text": "<h3>Third-party tested</h3><p>Seatopia third-party lab tests every supplier, and then continues to audit them regularly to ensure that they consistently meet their standards. Tested to under 0.1 ppm mercury &ndash; a tenth of the FDA limit, with no microplastics detected in third-party testing.</p><h3>Ethical sourcing</h3><p>We support marine habitat restoration, biodiversity and fair-trade jobs through regenerative aquaculture practices &mdash; a different model from commodity seafood.</p><h3>Uncompromising quality</h3><p>Meticulous farming practices and strict quality control, for an unmatched culinary experience with every bite.</p>",
